IGEL_ADD_SUPPORT_FOR_MEDIATEK_MT7902
	  Add support for mt7902 (backport) into the kernel.

	  Source: External
	  URL: https://github.com/jetm/mediatek-mt7927-dkms/blob/master/mt7902-wifi-6.19.patch
diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt76/mt76_connac.h b/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt76/mt76_connac.h
